      "receiptSource": "Original Receipt in \u0027\u003Ci\u003EThe Experienced English Housekeeper\u003C/i\u003E\u0027 by Elizabeth Raffald (\u003Ca href=\u0022references.html#raffald-1769\u0022\u003E\u003Cb\u003ERaffald 1769\u003C/b\u003E\u003C/a\u003E)",
      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003EEgg and Bacon Pie to eat cold:\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\nSteep a few thin slices of bacon all night in water, to take out the salt, lay your bacon in the dish, beat eight eggs with a pint of thick cream, put in a little pepper and salt, and pour it on the bacon, lay over it a good cold paste, bake it a day before you want it in a moderate oven.\u003Cbr\u003E"
